@startuml
title Order status: transitions allowed by the business

hide empty description

state PENDING
state CONFIRMED
state REJECTED #FFCDD2
state UNDER_REVIEW #FFF8E1
state SHIPPED #ECEFF1
state DELIVERED #ECEFF1
state CANCELLED #ECEFF1

[*] --> PENDING : order placed
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : paid and stock secured
PENDING --> REJECTED : out of stock,\npayment refused\nor timed out
PENDING --> UNDER_REVIEW : an undo keeps failing
UNDER_REVIEW --> CONFIRMED : administrator
UNDER_REVIEW --> REJECTED : administrator
CONFIRMED --> SHIPPED : administrator
SHIPPED --> DELIVERED : administrator
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : customer cancels,\nstock returned, refunded
CONFIRMED --> UNDER_REVIEW : refund of a\ncancellation fails
UNDER_REVIEW --> CANCELLED : administrator
REJECTED --> [*]
DELIVERED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

legend right
  Grey: proposed, awaiting validation
endlegend
@enduml
